description	"Jedi Traditionalist

A master who eschews dueling prowess for excellent defense against blasters.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
-- 30% slower RoF
- Lightsaber (Yellow/Blue)
-- Saber Defense (2)
-- Blaster Defense/Deflect (3)
-- 42% less Red/8% more blue damage
-- 25% more special damage
-- EX Saber Throw (2) ^3[CS1]
--- 33% more damage

